m; vertical-align: -2.35em;\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-v class=\"mjx-c7D\" style=\"height: 5.2em; vertical-align: -2.35em;\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-mid><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-mid><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">}</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  </td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>To find a basis of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"85\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Null</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we need to solve the equation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"86\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and express the solution as a linear combination of linearly independent vectors. Those vectors form a basis of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"87\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Null</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The given matrix is already in row echelon form. So, the equation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"88\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> corresponds to the following system:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"89\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJ